        "Content": "RAY COOKE LETTINGS PLEASE FOLLOW US ON FACEBOOK AND INSTAGRAM AS PROPERTIES ARE ADVERTISED THERE FIRST VIDEO VIEWINGS AVAILABLE ON REQUEST\n*** STUNNING 2 BEDROOM / 2 BATHROOM APARTMENT *** REGISTER YOUR INTEREST TODAY ***\nRAY COOKE LETTINGS are delighted to present this superb two-bedroom, two-bathroom apartment to the rental market in the highly sought-after Eaton Terrace development, Rathcoole, Co. Dublin.\nThis bright and spacious apartment is presented in excellent condition throughout and offers well-proportioned living accommodation finished to a high standard. The property comprises a welcoming entrance hallway, a generous open-plan living and dining area, a modern fully fitted kitchen with integrated appliances, two spacious double bedrooms with fitted wardrobes, a stylish main bathroom, and a master bedroom complete with an en suite bathroom.\nA standout feature of this superb apartment is the dual outdoor space, benefiting from both a front balcony and a private rear balcony, providing excellent areas for relaxing, entertaining, or enjoying outdoor dining.\nEaton Terrace enjoys a prime location in the heart of Rathcoole Village, with a fantastic range of local shops, cafés, restaurants, parks, and leisure facilities all within walking distance. The area benefits from excellent transport links, including regular Dublin Bus services and easy access to the N7, M50 and surrounding road networks, making commuting to Dublin City Centre and beyond both quick and convenient.\nThis is an excellent opportunity to secure a quality home in one of South Dublin's most desirable commuter locations. Early interest is highly recommended.\nAdditional Features:\nStunning 2 Bed / 2 Bath apartment\nMaster bedroom with en suite bathroom\nBright and spacious living accommodation\nTwo spacious double bedrooms with fitted wardrobes\nFront and rear balconies\nHighly sought-after residential development\nWalking distance to Rathcoole Village and local amenities\nExcellent transport links with easy access to the N7, M50 and Dublin City Centre\nRegister your interest today\n \nRAY COOKE LETTINGS EMAIL ENQUIRIES ONLY / NO PHONE CALLS PLEASE FILL IN YOUR CONTACT INFORMATION ON THE RIGHT-HAND SIDE AND CLICK SEND MESSAGE WE WILL CONTACT YOU WITH VIEWING DETAILS WHEN THEY ARISE."
